{"Title":"An Act related to the use of hoisting equipment in Chapter 74 vocational technical education \r\n","BillNumber":"S1577","DocketNumber":"SD1778","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MRP0","Name":"Marc R. Pacheco","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MRP0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T21:08:05.827"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MRP0","Name":"Marc R. Pacheco","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MRP0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T21:08:05.8266667"},{"Id":"JPL1","Name":"Jack Patrick Lewis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JPL1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-30T10:48:43.85"},{"Id":"MOM0","Name":"Michael O. Moore","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MOM0","ResponseDate":"2023-03-23T18:08:08.5433333"},{"Id":"CAD1","Name":"Carol A. Doherty","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CAD1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-23T18:08:08.5433333"},{"Id":"PJK1","Name":"Patrick Joseph Kearney","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PJK1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-23T18:08:08.5433333"},{"Id":"SSH1","Name":"Steven S. Howitt","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SSH1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-27T12:35:27.78"},{"Id":"JMC0","Name":"Joanne M. Comerford","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JMC0","ResponseDate":"2023-04-26T14:14:49.6333333"},{"Id":"MSV1","Name":"Marcus S. Vaughn","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MSV1","ResponseDate":"2023-04-26T14:14:49.6333333"},{"Id":"JRO0","Name":"Jacob R. Oliveira","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JRO0","ResponseDate":"2023-10-19T13:39:07.9166667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S1577/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Pacheco, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1577) of Marc R. Pacheco and Jack Patrick Lewis for legislation related to the use of hoisting equipment in Chapter 74 vocational technical education.  Public Safety and Homeland Security.","DocumentText":"\tSection 53 of chapter 146 of the General Laws is hereby amended by adding after subsection (g) a new subsection (h):-\r\n\t(h) Any public high school that operates hoisting equipment as part of a vocational technical education program approved under chapter 74, shall be exempt from this section if the school has met the requirements of clauses (i) and (ii) of subsection (e) and the supervising instructor is on site at all times of operation and holds a license issued by the division of occupational licensure under this section and is designated as the responsible person in charge of hoisting equipment during that period of operation.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J22","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J22"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}